'''Mutated Blaze''' is a [[Blaze]]-type [[Mob]] that spawns in the [[Crimson Isle]].

== Spawning ==
'''Mutated Blazes''' will spawn randomly in the {{zone|Stronghold}} on the {{zone|Crimson Isle}}.

== Behavior ==
The '''Mutated Blaze''' uses the same behavior as a normal [[Blaze]], floating upwards and shooting fireballs at any nearby player.

